{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026eFlJI8czN21795735740.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國總統特朗普指責政府，蓄意在中期選舉前虛報經濟增長表現，要求展開調查。</p><p></p><p>特朗普在社交媒體發文，指美國商務部將第三季國內生產總值，按年率計向上大幅修訂為增長百分之4.3，遠高於初值的百分之3.4。認為是一個重大差異，絕非一個小的失誤，而是一個嚴重且蓄意造成的錯誤，並要求立即展開調查。他並暗示，最初公佈的數據或影響美國期中選舉的結果。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T00:04:28.874707+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T23:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T04:57:11.832942+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T23:57:37.230986+00:00","content_hash":"ab8a94c0be8afcc4f609c0d84007da59e79763894dcd6b172a86451a7d8f1efd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T00:04:28.874707+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}